ence group than in non-recurrent cases. Patients with KRT1-positive immunostaining exhibited trends of worse overall survival (OS) and recurrence-free survival (RFS). In vitro studies showed that KRT1 knockdown suppressed tumor cell invasion, cell migration, and expression of epithelial-mesenchymal transition (EMT)-related genes in human head and neck squamous cell carcinoma (HNSCC) cell lines. Additionally, KRT1 knockdown enhanced tumor cell apoptosis and exhibited synergistic effects with conventional radiation and chemotherapy treatments. KRT1 may serve as a biomarker for predicting advanced laryngeal cancer recurrence and assist with selecting patients to receive concurrent chemoradiotherapy (CCRT).","gpl":"24676","gse":"293443","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2025/04/01","suppfile":"CSV","samples":[{"accession":"GSM8882393","title":"L28_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882376","title":"L11_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882396","title":"L31_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882379","title":"L14_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882373","title":"L8_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882385","title":"L20_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882382","title":"L17_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882374","title":"L9_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882394","title":"L29_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882368","title":"L3_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882388","title":"L23_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882371","title":"L6_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882391","title":"L26_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882397","title":"L32_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882366","title":"L1_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882386","title":"L21_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882377","title":"L12_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882369","title":"L4_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882389","title":"L24_NON_RECURRENT"},{"accession":"GSM8882380","title":"L15_NON