high proportion of abnormal cell apoptosis and cell chromosome division mismatches in HNSCC cell line. RNA-seq and RT-PCR assay results revealed that KIF2C knockdown influenced the expression levels of PDGFA, CCNA1, RRM1, CCND2, CAV1, EGFR, SNAI2, KRT5, KRT14, NID1, TP63. TGFBR2, TGFB2, ICAM1, ITGB2, CDH2, CDH5, FN1. And KIF2C knockdown also decreased the phos-phorylation of mTOR, AKT, and ERK. Furthermore, in vivo studies have demonstrated that KIF2C knockdown significantly inhibits tumor proliferation in nude mice. As such, our study highlights the potential therapeutic role of KIF2C for HNSCC treatment.","gpl":"30209","gse":"253500","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2024/01/21","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM8021751","title":"FaDu cells,shKIF2C,Day2"},{"accession":"GSM8021750","title":"FaDu cells,shControl,Day2"}],"relations":[],"extrelations":[],"n_samples":2,"seriestitle":"","platformtitle":"","platformtaxa":"","samplestaxa":"","pubmedids":[],"projects":[],"ftplink":"ftp://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/series/GSE253nnn/GSE253500/","geo2r":"yes","bioproject":"PRJNA1065903"},"200234138":{"uid":"200234138","accession":"GSE234138","gds":"","title":"Capturing the dynamic interactions between tumor and immune components of the tumor micro-environment is important for determining efficacy of anti-PD1 treatment","summary":"This SuperSeries is composed of the SubSeries listed below.","gpl":"27956","gse":"234138","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by array","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2024/01/09","suppfile":"RCC","samples":[{"accession":"GSM7446595","title":"Patient13 20015-Control"},{"accession":"GSM8000242","title":"Patient21-20100"},{"accession":"GSM7446615","title":"Patient2 20200-Nivo"},{"accession":"GSM7446635","title":"Patient22 20085-Nivo"},{"accessi